sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Provider
    actor Client
    participant Web as Web application
    participant API as Application API
    participant DB as Relational database
    participant Jobs as Outbox and queue
    participant Worker as Background worker
    participant Email as Email provider
    participant Stripe
    participant Store as Private object storage

    Provider->>Web: Review stage and selected evidence
    Web->>API: Submit immutable revision
    API->>DB: Authorize provider and lock stage
    API->>DB: Commit revision, evidence links,<br/>timeline event, and notification job
    DB-->>API: Revision 1 committed
    API-->>Web: Submission accepted

    Jobs-->>Worker: Client-review notification job
    Worker->>Email: Send invitation without private evidence
    Email-->>Worker: Delivery outcome
    Worker->>DB: Record delivery state

    Client->>Web: Open invitation and verify email code
    Web->>API: Request revision and evidence access
    API->>DB: Verify session and project grant
    API-->>Web: Authorized revision metadata
    Web->>API: Request scoped evidence access
    API->>Store: Create short-lived download grant
    Store-->>Web: Authorized evidence response

    alt Client sends Change Request
        Client->>Web: Submit specific request
        Web->>API: Record decision for revision 1
        API->>DB: Lock pending revision
        API->>DB: Commit terminal Change Request,<br/>timeline event, and provider notification job
        DB-->>API: Decision committed
        API-->>Web: Change Request recorded

        Jobs-->>Worker: Provider notification job
        Worker->>Email: Send Change Request notice

        Provider->>Web: Add response and revised evidence
        Web->>API: Submit revision 2
        API->>DB: Commit linked immutable revision 2,<br/>timeline event, and client notification job
        DB-->>API: Revision 2 committed
        API-->>Web: Resubmission accepted

        Client->>Web: Review revision 2
        Web->>API: Approve revision 2
    else Client approves revision 1
        Client->>Web: Approve revision 1
        Web->>API: Record approval for revision 1
    end

    API->>DB: Lock pending revision and enforce<br/>one terminal decision
    API->>DB: Commit approval, draft invoice,<br/>timeline event, and provider notification job
    DB-->>API: Approval and draft invoice committed
    API-->>Web: Exact revision approved

    Provider->>Web: Review draft invoice
    Web->>API: Issue invoice with idempotency key
    API->>DB: Commit immutable invoice snapshot,<br/>official number, timeline event,<br/>and client notification job
    DB-->>API: Issued invoice committed
    API-->>Web: Invoice issued

    Client->>Web: Choose method and Pay balance
    Web->>Stripe: Enter payment credentials<br/>in Stripe-hosted surface
    Web->>API: Start payment with Stripe token<br/>and idempotency key
    API->>DB: Commit payment attempt
    API->>Stripe: Create payment operation
    Stripe-->>API: Attempt accepted or requires action
    API-->>Web: Payment processing<br/>invoice balance unchanged

    Stripe-->>API: Signed webhook with authoritative result
    API->>API: Verify signature and deduplicate event
    API->>DB: Commit successful payment event,<br/>fee references, zero balance projection,<br/>timeline event, and receipt job
    DB-->>API: Financial event committed
    API-->>Stripe: Webhook acknowledged

    Jobs-->>Worker: Receipt and notification jobs
    Worker->>Store: Generate and store receipt
    Worker->>Email: Send payment confirmation
    Worker->>DB: Record document and delivery outcomes

    Client->>Web: View receipt and paid project history
    Web->>API: Request invoice and project projection
    API->>DB: Read authoritative events and projections
    API-->>Web: Paid invoice, receipt reference,<br/>and updated paid-to-date
